ADDITIONAL NOTICE — FINANCIAL RISK

This software is capable of placing real orders in a real brokerage account
using real money. It can lose some or all of the funds in any account it is
connected to.

Nothing in this repository is investment advice, a trading strategy, a
recommendation, or any promise or projection of returns. The authors are not
brokers, dealers, or investment advisers.

The default configuration values in guardrail/limits.json are illustrative
examples, not recommendations. They have not been tuned for your account, your
risk tolerance, or your jurisdiction, and using them unchanged is not safe.

By connecting a broker and arming this software you accept sole and complete
responsibility for every order it places and every loss that results. See the
LIMITATION OF LIABILITY above: it applies in full, including to losses of
capital.
